      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_511cbaddc21f372e_2",
        "edit": "Invert the enable condition: change `if(ena)` to `if(!ena)` so that y is forced to 0 when ena is low, matching the oracle at cycle 0 (expected 00000000).",
